feat(scripts): add performance metrics to the probe CLI

Instrument the CompletionClient with a timing wrapper: per-request-kind
stats (count/avg/min/max for topTokens and continueText), per-candidate
extension time and word count, and phase wall-clock — highlighting
"strip ready" time, i.e. what the user actually waits for after the
trigger keystroke, separately from the idle greedy extension.

